sequenceDiagram
  title Checkout
  autonumber
  actor U as Shopper
  participant W as Web App
  participant P as Payments API
  participant D@{ "type": "database" } as Orders
  U->>W: POST /checkout {"cart": "c-1"}
  W->>+P: POST /charges
  alt Card accepted
    P-->>-W: 201 {"chargeId": "ch_1"}
    par Save and notify
      W->>D: INSERT order
    and
      W-)U: OrderConfirmed
    end
    W-->>U: 200
  else Card declined
    P-->>W: 402
    W-->>U: 402 {"error": "declined"}
  end
  loop Every line item
    W->>D: UPDATE stock
  end
  Note right of W: Truncated payloads lose their body
  W->>D: AUDIT {"items": [1, 2…
